<section class="section styleguide">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="collection-page__head">
      <p class="t-eyebrow">Internal</p>
      <h1 class="t-h1">Styleguide</h1>
      <p class="t-small">Token visualisation. Hide this page from the navigation in production.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="styleguide__block">
      <h2 class="t-h3">Type scale</h2>
      <p class="t-hero">The Hero — Italiana</p>
      <p class="t-h1">Heading 1 — Italiana</p>
      <p class="t-h2">Heading 2 — Italiana</p>
      <p class="t-h3">Heading 3 — Inter uppercase</p>
      <p class="t-body">Body copy — Inter 400 at 16px / 1.7 line-height. The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</p>
      <p class="t-small">Small / meta — Inter 400 at 13px.</p>
      <p class="t-eyebrow">Eyebrow — Inter 500 uppercase</p>
      <p class="t-italic">Italic accent — Cormorant Garamond italic for perfumer attribution.</p>
    </div>

    <hr class="hairline">

    <div class="styleguide__block">
      <h2 class="t-h3">Colours</h2>
      <div class="swatch-grid">
        <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper);">Ink</div>
        <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); border:1px solid var(--hairline);">Paper</div>
        <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--paper-alt); color:var(--ink);">Paper alt</div>
        <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--champagne); color:var(--ink);">Champagne</div>
        <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--champagne-deep); color:var(--paper);">Champagne deep</div>
        <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--smoke); color:var(--paper);">Smoke</div>
        <div class="swatch" style="background:var(--hairline); color:var(--ink);">Hairline</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="hairline">

    <div class="styleguide__block">
      <h2 class="t-h3">Buttons</h2>
      <div class="styleguide__row">
        <button class="btn">Add to bag</button>
        <button class="btn btn--ghost">Continue shopping</button>
        <button class="btn btn--small">Apply</button>
        <a href="#" class="btn--inline">Inline link</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="hairline">

    <div class="styleguide__block">
      <h2 class="t-h3">Forms</h2>
      <div style="max-width:460px;">
        <label class="field">
          <span class="field__label">Email</span>
          <input type="email" class="field__input" placeholder="hello@maison.com">
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span class="field__label">Message</span>
          <textarea class="field__textarea"></textarea>
        </label>
        <p class="t-eyebrow" style="margin-top:var(--space-4);">Pill group</p>
        <div class="pill-group">
          <button class="pill" aria-checked="false">10ml</button>
          <button class="pill" aria-checked="true">50ml</button>
          <button class="pill" aria-checked="false">100ml</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="hairline">

    <div class="styleguide__block">
      <h2 class="t-h3">Disclosure</h2>
      <details class="disclosure">
        <summary class="disclosure__summary">Delivery & returns</summary>
        <div class="disclosure__body">Complimentary shipping on all orders. Returns accepted within 30 days, unopened.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="disclosure">
        <summary class="disclosure__summary">Wear & presence</summary>
        <div class="disclosure__body">Longevity 8 hours. Sillage moderate.</div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <hr class="hairline">

    <div class="styleguide__block">
      <h2 class="t-h3">Prose</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>From the first note to the long, unfolding base, this composition was built around a single memory of citrus burnt by the August sun. The drop cap on this paragraph demonstrates the editorial treatment.</p>
        <p>A second paragraph, to verify the rhythm of the line-height and paragraph spacing.</p>
        <blockquote>A perfume is a memory bottled before it could be photographed.</blockquote>
        <p>And after the pull quote, prose continues at the standard width.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .styleguide__block { padding-block: var(--space-5); }
  .styleguide__block > h2 { margin-bottom: var(--space-4); color: var(--smoke); }
  .styleguide__row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-3); align-items: center; }
  .swatch-grid { display: grid; gap: var(--space-2); grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  @media (min-width: 750px) { .swatch-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
  .swatch { padding: var(--space-4); font-size: var(--type-small); letter-spacing: var(--ls-meta); text-transform: uppercase; aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; }
</style>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "Styleguide", "settings": [] }
{% endschema %}
